1
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,460
=As Promised=

2
00:00:52,460 --> 00:00:53,980
(Adapted from "The Villain's Guide to Love",
a story on Zhihu Yanyan)

3
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,900
=Episode 8=

4
00:01:03,710 --> 00:01:05,000
Ten years ago,

5
00:01:05,590 --> 00:01:06,590
in Lingnan,

6
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:10,760
I fell in love
with a young man at first sight.

7
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:13,980
(Ten Years Ago. Lingnan)
(When I was young,)

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,790
(my parents had already
contracted tuberculosis.)

9
00:01:16,430 --> 00:01:17,950
(I often set up a stall at the market)

10
00:01:17,950 --> 00:01:19,480
(to sell ink sticks
and help pay for their medicine.)

11
00:01:20,760 --> 00:01:21,400
(That day,)

12
00:01:22,350 --> 00:01:23,840
(human traffickers
set their sights on me.)

13
00:01:26,430 --> 00:01:27,070
Let go of me!

14
00:01:27,070 --> 00:01:29,350
- (When they took me to their hideout,)
- Let go of me!

15
00:01:29,990 --> 00:01:31,150
- (I was terrified.)
- Let me out!

16
00:01:31,150 --> 00:01:32,280
We'll get a good price for her.

17
00:01:32,430 --> 00:01:33,480
(All I could think about)

18
00:01:34,200 --> 00:01:35,400
(was that even if it cost me my life,)

19
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,590
(I had to get back to my parents.)

20
00:01:36,590 --> 00:01:37,590
Let me out!

21
00:01:45,310 --> 00:01:47,000
Let me out!

22
00:01:54,350 --> 00:01:55,640
Don't touch me! I'll hit you!

23
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:56,840
Don't touch me!

24
00:02:02,820 --> 00:02:03,810
The traffickers have been captured.

25
00:02:04,070 --> 00:02:04,840
Hurry home.

26
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,400
May I have my savior's name

27
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:12,840
so I can repay you someday?

28
00:02:16,710 --> 00:02:18,360
This is the Crown Prince.

29
00:02:18,360 --> 00:02:19,710
His name is not for you to ask.

30
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,520
Live well.

31
00:02:23,710 --> 00:02:25,310
A safe and happy life
will be repayment enough.

32
00:02:26,470 --> 00:02:27,960
Make sure they all get home safely.

33
00:02:28,240 --> 00:02:29,030
Yes.

34
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:33,190
(So,)

35
00:02:33,590 --> 00:02:34,840
my feelings for Zhao Junyao,

36
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,360
which I kept hidden for years,

37
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:39,910
actually began with that
unforgettable first encounter.

38
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,400
During the palace coup,

39
00:02:41,710 --> 00:02:43,280
I risked my life to save him

40
00:02:43,630 --> 00:02:45,750
because I believed
he had once saved mine.

41
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:48,400
It wasn't until

42
00:02:54,590 --> 00:02:55,910
I happened to see

43
00:02:55,910 --> 00:02:57,870
Your Highness's old scar that I realized

44
00:02:58,520 --> 00:02:59,520
that perhaps,

45
00:02:59,870 --> 00:03:01,000
all this time,

46
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,400
I had

47
00:03:03,840 --> 00:03:04,840
mistaken him for someone else.

48
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:11,150
Ten years ago in Lingnan,

49
00:03:12,750 --> 00:03:13,910
the person who saved me

50
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,190
was you, wasn't it?

51
00:03:18,840 --> 00:03:20,150
Ten years ago,

52
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,030
Zhao Junyao didn't want to accompany
His Majesty on his inspection tour of Lingnan,

53
00:03:23,960 --> 00:03:25,030
so he begged me to go in his place.

54
00:03:30,310 --> 00:03:32,430
I never thought the girl
who bit me back then

55
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,190
was you.

56
00:03:57,910 --> 00:03:58,710
Remember,

57
00:03:58,710 --> 00:04:00,630
your task is to win
the Crown Prince's heart.

58
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:04,680
You're not allowed to fall for me.

59
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:09,150
Just because you say so?

60
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:14,190
What are you mumbling about?

61
00:04:14,470 --> 00:04:15,030
Ow!

62
00:04:15,030 --> 00:04:16,310
Speak up. I can't hear you.

63
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:16,950
Ow!

64
00:04:19,310 --> 00:04:20,510
It's nothing.

65
00:04:20,870 --> 00:04:21,920
I said

66
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:24,000
I'll find a way to get you out of here.

67
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,070
Before this,

68
00:04:31,430 --> 00:04:33,360
you were able to win
the Crown Prince's heart

69
00:04:33,680 --> 00:04:36,390
because I was helping you
behind the scenes.

70
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,630
But now,

71
00:04:40,270 --> 00:04:41,680
I'm trapped here,

72
00:04:42,240 --> 00:04:43,390
and you could easily
fall out of his favor.

73
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,120
How are you going to help me?

74
00:04:46,310 --> 00:04:47,160
Don't underestimate me.

75
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,800
Then let's make a bet.

76
00:04:50,510 --> 00:04:51,830
If this time

77
00:04:51,830 --> 00:04:53,120
I manage to get you out of here,

78
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:54,270
then

79
00:04:56,000 --> 00:04:57,560
you'll grant me one wish.

80
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,160
How about it?

81
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:01,680
What wish?

82
00:05:04,870 --> 00:05:06,160
I haven't thought of one yet.

83
00:05:07,070 --> 00:05:08,040
Wait until I've done it,

84
00:05:08,270 --> 00:05:09,190
then I'll tell you.

85
00:05:22,460 --> 00:05:24,460
(Wenhua Hall)

86
00:05:32,830 --> 00:05:33,390
Xiaoyuan,

87
00:05:34,240 --> 00:05:34,800
thank you.

88
00:05:35,830 --> 00:05:36,830
It's so late,

89
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,560
yet you're still willing to stay
and help me check the accounts.

90
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:41,600
No need to thank me, Your Highness.

91
00:05:42,270 --> 00:05:43,240
I'm glad

92
00:05:43,360 --> 00:05:44,190
I can help.

93
00:05:45,830 --> 00:05:47,480
(I don't have much choice anyway.)

94
00:05:47,830 --> 00:05:49,430
(I can't finally learn
who really saved me)

95
00:05:49,800 --> 00:05:51,160
(and then just watch him die.)

96
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:03,310
The ink on these pages

97
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:04,600
has a rather distinctive scent.

98
00:06:05,820 --> 00:06:06,730
Is there something special about it?

99
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:09,870
The first note
is the crisp scent of pine soot,

100
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:11,680
but underneath it

101
00:06:11,680 --> 00:06:13,750
is the cheap, smoky smell
of tung oil from the marketplace.

102
00:06:14,510 --> 00:06:16,560
So this must be tung-oil ink.

103
00:06:16,680 --> 00:06:18,480
But its scent doesn't last long,

104
00:06:19,680 --> 00:06:20,630
so these words

105
00:06:21,310 --> 00:06:22,800
must have been written quite recently.

106
00:06:31,480 --> 00:06:32,560
The way the sheen
has soaked into the paper

107
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:33,630
is indeed different.

108
00:06:34,510 --> 00:06:35,190
Xiaoyuan,

109
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:37,680
can you determine

110
00:06:37,870 --> 00:06:38,830
how old the ink in this ledger is?

111
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:41,510
An ink maker knows ink best.

112
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,040
The writing here

113
00:06:43,430 --> 00:06:44,920
can't be more than three months old.

114
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:46,430
The military funds went missing

115
00:06:46,630 --> 00:06:48,040
a year ago,

116
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:49,600
but these entries

117
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,310
were made only three months ago.

118
00:06:52,830 --> 00:06:54,160
We finally have a lead.

119
00:06:54,310 --> 00:06:55,310
In that case,

120
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:56,560
there really is more to

121
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,870
Seventh Brother's corruption case.

122
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,830
I'll report this to Father right away.

123
00:06:59,830 --> 00:07:00,480
The ledger.

124
00:07:06,240 --> 00:07:07,040
Xiaoyuan,

125
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:10,310
you truly are a treasure
sent to me by heaven.

126
00:07:18,980 --> 00:07:21,460
(Wenhua Hall)

127
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,390
Your Highness.

128
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:29,720
(Ning Residence Accounts. Ledger)

129
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,240
Yu Feilin.

130
00:07:33,600 --> 00:07:35,510
My seventh brother has never
had any quarrel with your family.

131
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:37,750
Why did the Yu family single him out

132
00:07:37,750 --> 00:07:39,750
and frame him for embezzlement?

133
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:40,720
Your Highness,

134
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,600
the Yu family has always
served your mother's clan.

135
00:07:44,070 --> 00:07:45,800
Heaven and earth
can attest to our loyalty.

136
00:07:46,390 --> 00:07:48,560
And my devotion to you runs even deeper.

137
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,800
How could I possibly harm
your own brother for no reason?

138
00:07:50,800 --> 00:07:52,600
But the Seventh Prince is highly
skilled in political maneuvering

139
00:07:52,600 --> 00:07:53,830
and adept at reading
people's intentions.

140
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,750
He poses a grave threat
to your path to the throne.

141
00:07:55,750 --> 00:07:57,160
You must be wary of him.

142
00:07:57,360 --> 00:07:58,800
Whatever my shortcomings,

143
00:07:59,270 --> 00:08:01,240
I still know that one should trust
capable men, especially one's own kin.

144
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:03,560
Your Yu family are merely
officials outside the imperial clan,

145
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:05,360
yet you seek to drive a wedge
between me and my brother.

146
00:08:05,630 --> 00:08:07,070
How am I to know

147
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:09,560
whether your family intends
to dominate the court one day?

148
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:11,750
Your Highness,

149
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:13,480
my father...

150
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:15,160
The Yu family...

151
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,160
Enough, Yu Feilin.

152
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:18,800
Go back and tell your father

153
00:08:19,310 --> 00:08:20,360
that this kind of help

154
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,750
is not something I need,

155
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:23,680
nor do I wish to see it again.

156
00:08:34,670 --> 00:08:38,200
By the Mandate of Heaven,
the Emperor hereby decrees.

157
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:40,030
Upon investigation,

158
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:42,670
the Seventh Prince's alleged
embezzlement of military funds

159
00:08:42,670 --> 00:08:44,120
has been proven
to be a false accusation.

160
00:08:44,510 --> 00:08:46,120
His restrictions are hereby lifted,

161
00:08:46,750 --> 00:08:48,270
and all his subordinates

162
00:08:48,270 --> 00:08:50,150
shall be restored to their former posts.

163
00:08:51,550 --> 00:08:52,240
Your Highness.

164
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:53,240
We've confirmed

165
00:08:53,630 --> 00:08:55,440
that both the cellar trap and the false
charges over the military funds

166
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:56,750
were the work of Yu Feilin

167
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:58,630
and the Yu family behind her.

168
00:09:00,790 --> 00:09:03,360
The Yu family has certainly
extended its reach far and wide.

169
00:09:04,200 --> 00:09:06,200
It seems they consider
the position of Crown Princess

170
00:09:06,510 --> 00:09:08,360
already theirs for the taking.

171
00:09:08,790 --> 00:09:09,670
All these years,

172
00:09:09,910 --> 00:09:12,150
they've feared I might pose
a threat to the Crown Prince

173
00:09:12,630 --> 00:09:15,030
and planted plenty of spies around me.

174
00:09:15,510 --> 00:09:16,240
I imagine

175
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:18,150
they may have already noticed

176
00:09:18,670 --> 00:09:19,480
your relationship

177
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:20,750
with He Xiaoyuan.

178
00:09:21,150 --> 00:09:22,320
They're nothing but petty troublemakers.

179
00:09:22,790 --> 00:09:23,600
There's no need to fear them.

180
00:09:27,320 --> 00:09:27,840
Your Highness.

181
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,320
This came from the Women's Academy.

182
00:09:29,510 --> 00:09:30,480
Another one from the Princess?

183
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:31,550
Give it to me.

184
00:09:31,790 --> 00:09:32,910
Lord Fu,

185
00:09:33,030 --> 00:09:33,960
this note

186
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:36,000
was specifically addressed
to the Seventh Prince.

187
00:09:46,390 --> 00:09:47,000
(Zhao Boqing.)

188
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:48,080
(I did it.)

189
00:09:48,550 --> 00:09:49,550
(My wish)

190
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:51,870
(is to see the lanterns with you
during the Lantern Festival.)

191
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,080
(I'll be waiting for you.)

192
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,910
(The Lantern Festival...)

193
00:09:55,980 --> 00:09:59,460
- All right.
- All right.

194
00:10:06,910 --> 00:10:08,750
You made this lantern for Boqing
to repay his kindness?

195
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:10,960
It's quite pretty.

196
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:11,960
But

197
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:13,120
what a waste.

198
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,000
You don't know, do you?

199
00:10:16,270 --> 00:10:17,910
Boqing never takes part
in the Lantern Festival.

200
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,750
This design is really nice.

201
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:30,670
Take a look.

202
00:10:31,030 --> 00:10:32,080
So later,

203
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:33,960
only the Crown Prince
will be joining us.

204
00:10:34,510 --> 00:10:35,150
Why?

205
00:10:42,670 --> 00:10:44,440
Boqing's mother passed away

206
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:45,960
during the Lantern Festival.

207
00:10:46,750 --> 00:10:49,120
That night, the palace fireworks
lit up the sky like day,

208
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,630
but in his mother's palace,

209
00:10:52,270 --> 00:10:54,000
it was so cold that no one even
thought to tend the charcoal fire.

210
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:57,150
He knelt on the palace steps,
crying out for an Imperial Physician,

211
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,790
but the firecrackers
were deafening that night.

212
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:02,320
Who could have heard
a child's desperate cries?

213
00:11:03,150 --> 00:11:04,080
From that night on,

214
00:11:04,510 --> 00:11:05,390
Boqing developed

215
00:11:05,390 --> 00:11:07,270
a fear of firecrackers and fireworks.

216
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,600
Every Lantern Festival,

217
00:11:10,150 --> 00:11:11,600
he shuts himself away in Qingyan Palace.

218
00:11:29,870 --> 00:11:30,840
(So...)

219
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:33,960
(Zhao Boqing had such a painful past.)

220
00:11:34,670 --> 00:11:35,840
(I know)

221
00:11:36,480 --> 00:11:37,510
(so little about him.)

222
00:11:37,720 --> 00:11:38,720
Your Highness.

223
00:11:40,150 --> 00:11:40,870
Your Highness.

224
00:11:41,120 --> 00:11:42,120
What took you so long?

225
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:43,600
The Lantern Festival

226
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:44,720
is so lively this year!

227
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:46,670
Your Highness,

228
00:11:46,790 --> 00:11:47,910
what fun things are there to do tonight?

229
00:11:51,910 --> 00:11:53,240
It's so beautiful!

230
00:11:54,550 --> 00:11:56,150
Xiaoyuan, is there
anything you'd like to do?

231
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:00,720
Your Highness.

232
00:12:01,200 --> 00:12:02,080
I've long heard

233
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,000
that Miss Mu, the top courtesan,
is superb at both zither and dance.

234
00:12:04,600 --> 00:12:06,200
Haven't we always
wanted to see her perform?

235
00:12:06,790 --> 00:12:08,080
She's upstairs right now.

236
00:12:08,220 --> 00:12:08,670
Why don't we...

237
00:12:08,670 --> 00:12:09,360
Sure.

238
00:12:09,510 --> 00:12:11,000
I've never been to
a pleasure house before anyway.

239
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:12,390
(This is bad.)

240
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:14,270
Let's go, Xiaoyuan.

241
00:12:15,200 --> 00:12:15,960
This is exciting!

242
00:12:16,360 --> 00:12:17,120
Let's go.

243
00:12:17,870 --> 00:12:19,240
- Here you go.
- Come take a look!

244
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:19,630
Hurry.

245
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:22,510
Let's go.

246
00:12:22,550 --> 00:12:23,630
Here you go. Thank you.

247
00:12:23,870 --> 00:12:25,000
- Good.
- Good.

248
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,440
- Good.
- Good.

249
00:12:27,670 --> 00:12:28,440
Take care.

250
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,030
Eat it while it's hot.

251
00:12:31,910 --> 00:12:32,510
Your Highness.

252
00:12:32,750 --> 00:12:33,630
Your Highness.

253
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:35,750
I'm terribly sorry,

254
00:12:35,960 --> 00:12:37,240
but Tingting

255
00:12:37,270 --> 00:12:38,720
received an honored guest
just moments ago.

256
00:12:38,750 --> 00:12:41,150
Wouldn't it be rude for us to barge in?

257
00:12:42,240 --> 00:12:43,000
What honored guest

258
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,790
could be more important
than the Crown Prince and Princess?

259
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:45,440
Well...

260
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,000
At worst,

261
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:47,200
we can all go in

262
00:12:47,320 --> 00:12:48,000
and have a drink together.

263
00:12:49,270 --> 00:12:49,630
Well...

264
00:12:50,600 --> 00:12:51,000
Please.

265
00:12:58,720 --> 00:12:59,870
Boqing?

266
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:01,550
Boqing?

267
00:13:01,910 --> 00:13:04,390
So you're the honored guest
Tingting is entertaining.

268
00:13:22,740 --> 00:13:25,060
♪My longing has nowhere to rest♪

269
00:13:25,420 --> 00:13:27,100
♪Through the storm, I drift and sway♪

270
00:13:27,740 --> 00:13:30,740
♪You are the prayer I hold in my palm♪

271
00:13:31,260 --> 00:13:35,580
♪In one frozen moment,
my tears come into focus♪

272
00:13:35,580 --> 00:13:38,340
♪My heart has long known♪

273
00:13:38,780 --> 00:13:40,780
♪We made a promise long ago♪

274
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,700
♪To stay together until the end of time♪

275
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:46,700
♪You are the fate I cannot escape♪

276
00:13:47,020 --> 00:13:49,860
♪How much must I let go♪

277
00:13:50,180 --> 00:13:51,860
♪For one moment♪

